  "sale_events": [],
  "body": "Commanding an exceptional position above Castor Bay, 3A Eastcliffe Road is a substantial new coastal residence where extraordinary Gulf views, uncompromising construction and beautifully considered family living come together. Privately accessed from Eastcliffe Road, sweeping views across Castor Bay and the Hauraki Gulf to Rangitoto Island and north towards Tiritiri Matangi provide an ever changing backdrop to this remarkable home.\r\n\r\nConstructed in concrete and steel, the home delivers outstanding acoustic and thermal qualities, while washed cedar, European oak flooring and beautiful New Zealand wool carpet introduce warmth, texture and refinement throughout.\r\n\r\nAt the heart of the home, an expansive open-plan kitchen, dining and living space has been designed to maximise both entertaining and the spectacular outlook. The beautifully appointed kitchen and generous scullery anchor the space, while the living area flows effortlessly to a large ocean-facing deck. Consent is already in place for a louvre roof, giving the next owner the opportunity to further enhance this impressive outdoor living area.\r\n\r\nUpstairs, the primary suite captures some of the home's most spectacular views. Generous in scale, with a substantial walk-in wardrobe and beautifully finished ensuite, it creates a private retreat overlooking Rangitoto and the Hauraki Gulf. A second ensuite bedroom completes this level.\r\n\r\nThe levels below have been cleverly designed to provide family and guests with genuine independence. A dedicated cinema with in-ceiling surround sound, separate living area with bar fridge and wine storage, generous laundry, additional bedrooms and bathrooms create multiple spaces to entertain, relax or simply spread out.\r\n\r\nOutdoor living continues around the concrete swimming pool – a private setting that connects naturally with the home's second living zone and provides another superb space for entertaining.\r\n\r\nFive bedrooms, four bathrooms and multiple living areas offer exceptional flexibility for families of all ages, while the double internal-access garage, generous turning area and additional off-street parking make the home remarkably practical for its elevated coastal position.\r\n\r\nWhile the scale is impressive, it is the combination of privacy, construction quality and breathtaking outlook that truly sets 3A Eastcliffe Road apart.\r\n\r\nSet on 480sqm of freehold land with approximately 425sqm of floor area, this is a home designed and built for the long term in one of the North Shore's most desirable coastal neighbourhoods. Castor Bay Beach is moments away, Milford and Takapuna are within easy reach, and the property sits within highly sought-after school zones.\r\n\r\n3A Eastcliffe Road presents a rare opportunity to secure a substantial new coastal home in the heart of Castor Bay.\r\n\r\nWe welcome all conjunctional enquiries!\r\n\r\nThis specular home needs to be experienced in person.  VIEW BY PRIVATE APPOINTMENT OR OPEN HOME",
